*================================================================*
* Business Function Decomposition
* System  : DRIVER LICENSE ISSUANCE SYSTEM (DLIS)
*================================================================*

BUSINESS-AREA: DRIVER-LICENSE-ISSUANCE-SYSTEM

  *------------------------------------------------------------*
  * FUNCTION 1: CANDIDATE MANAGEMENT
  *------------------------------------------------------------*
  BUSINESS-FUNCTION: BF-CANDIDATE-MANAGEMENT
    DESCRIPTION: Manage candidate registration and maintenance
    PROCESS: PROC-CREATE-CANDIDATE
      DESCRIPTION: Register a new license candidate in the system
    PROCESS: PROC-MAINTAIN-CANDIDATE
      DESCRIPTION: Update existing candidate details
    PROCESS: PROC-INQUIRE-CANDIDATE
      DESCRIPTION: Inquire candidate details by ID or national number
    PROCESS: PROC-DEACTIVATE-CANDIDATE
      DESCRIPTION: Deactivate a candidate record

  *------------------------------------------------------------*
  * FUNCTION 2: LICENSE APPLICATION
  *------------------------------------------------------------*
  BUSINESS-FUNCTION: BF-LICENSE-APPLICATION
    DESCRIPTION: Capture and manage driver license applications
    PROCESS: PROC-CREATE-APPLICATION
      DESCRIPTION: Create a new license application for a candidate
                   Candidate selects license type: L, P or O
    PROCESS: PROC-INQUIRE-APPLICATION
      DESCRIPTION: Inquire application status and details
    PROCESS: PROC-CANCEL-APPLICATION
      DESCRIPTION: Cancel a pending application

  *------------------------------------------------------------*
  * FUNCTION 3: ELIGIBILITY CHECKING
  *------------------------------------------------------------*
  BUSINESS-FUNCTION: BF-ELIGIBILITY-CHECK
    DESCRIPTION: Verify candidate meets age and eligibility criteria
    PROCESS: PROC-CHECK-AGE-ELIGIBILITY
      DESCRIPTION: Validate minimum age requirements per license type
                   Learner >= 16, Probation >= 17, Open >= 18
    PROCESS: PROC-CHECK-ID-VALIDITY
      DESCRIPTION: Validate national ID number format and existence
    PROCESS: PROC-CHECK-EXISTING-LICENSE
      DESCRIPTION: Check if candidate already holds a license
                   Enforce correct upgrade path: L -> P -> O
    PROCESS: PROC-RECORD-ELIGIBILITY-RESULT
      DESCRIPTION: Record eligibility check result on application

  *------------------------------------------------------------*
  * FUNCTION 4: HISTORY CHECKING
  *------------------------------------------------------------*
  BUSINESS-FUNCTION: BF-HISTORY-CHECK
    DESCRIPTION: Review candidate's driving history for disqualifiers
    PROCESS: PROC-RETRIEVE-DRIVING-HISTORY
      DESCRIPTION: Read all active history records for candidate
    PROCESS: PROC-CHECK-ACTIVE-SUSPENSION
      DESCRIPTION: Determine if candidate is under active suspension
    PROCESS: PROC-CHECK-DEMERIT-POINTS
      DESCRIPTION: Tally total demerit points vs allowed threshold
    PROCESS: PROC-CHECK-UNPAID-FINES
      DESCRIPTION: Identify unpaid fines that block application
    PROCESS: PROC-RECORD-HISTORY-RESULT
      DESCRIPTION: Record history check result on application

  *------------------------------------------------------------*
  * FUNCTION 5: PAYMENT PROCESSING
  *------------------------------------------------------------*
  BUSINESS-FUNCTION: BF-PAYMENT-PROCESSING
    DESCRIPTION: Handle fee calculation and payment recording
    PROCESS: PROC-CALCULATE-FEE
      DESCRIPTION: Look up applicable fee from fee schedule for
                   the selected license type and fee type
    PROCESS: PROC-RECORD-PAYMENT
      DESCRIPTION: Record payment details against the application
    PROCESS: PROC-VERIFY-PAYMENT
      DESCRIPTION: Verify payment reference and confirm status
    PROCESS: PROC-GENERATE-RECEIPT
      DESCRIPTION: Generate payment receipt for candidate

  *------------------------------------------------------------*
  * FUNCTION 6: FIRST AUTHORITY APPROVAL
  *------------------------------------------------------------*
  BUSINESS-FUNCTION: BF-APPROVAL-AUTHORITY-1
    DESCRIPTION: First level authority review and approval
    PROCESS: PROC-RETRIEVE-PENDING-AUTH1
      DESCRIPTION: Retrieve applications pending first approval
    PROCESS: PROC-VALIDATE-AUTHORITY1-USER
      DESCRIPTION: Validate that approving officer is authorised
                   for level-1 approval of the requested license type
    PROCESS: PROC-RECORD-APPROVAL1
      DESCRIPTION: Record first authority approval or rejection decision
    PROCESS: PROC-NOTIFY-REJECTION-AUTH1
      DESCRIPTION: Generate rejection notification if auth1 rejected

  *------------------------------------------------------------*
  * FUNCTION 7: SECOND AUTHORITY APPROVAL
  *------------------------------------------------------------*
  BUSINESS-FUNCTION: BF-APPROVAL-AUTHORITY-2
    DESCRIPTION: Second level authority review and approval
    PROCESS: PROC-RETRIEVE-PENDING-AUTH2
      DESCRIPTION: Retrieve applications pending second approval
    PROCESS: PROC-VALIDATE-AUTHORITY2-USER
      DESCRIPTION: Validate that approving officer is authorised
                   for level-2 approval and is a different person
                   from the first approver
    PROCESS: PROC-RECORD-APPROVAL2
      DESCRIPTION: Record second authority approval or rejection decision
    PROCESS: PROC-NOTIFY-REJECTION-AUTH2
      DESCRIPTION: Generate rejection notification if auth2 rejected

  *------------------------------------------------------------*
  * FUNCTION 8: LICENSE ISSUANCE
  *------------------------------------------------------------*
  BUSINESS-FUNCTION: BF-LICENSE-ISSUANCE
    DESCRIPTION: Generate and issue the driver license
    PROCESS: PROC-VALIDATE-READY-FOR-ISSUE
      DESCRIPTION: Confirm all checks and approvals are satisfied
                   before issuing license
    PROCESS: PROC-GENERATE-LICENSE-NUMBER
      DESCRIPTION: Generate unique license number
    PROCESS: PROC-SET-LICENSE-EXPIRY
      DESCRIPTION: Calculate expiry date based on license type:
                   Learner = 1 year, Probation = 2 years, Open = 5 years
    PROCESS: PROC-CREATE-ISSUED-LICENSE
      DESCRIPTION: Create the ISSUED-LICENSE record
    PROCESS: PROC-UPDATE-APPLICATION-ISSUED
      DESCRIPTION: Update application status to IS=Issued
    PROCESS: PROC-PRINT-LICENSE
      DESCRIPTION: Trigger output of physical license card

  *------------------------------------------------------------*
  * FUNCTION 9: LICENSE INQUIRY AND MAINTENANCE
  *------------------------------------------------------------*
  BUSINESS-FUNCTION: BF-LICENSE-INQUIRY
    DESCRIPTION: Inquire and maintain issued licenses
    PROCESS: PROC-INQUIRE-LICENSE
      DESCRIPTION: Inquire an issued license by license number
    PROCESS: PROC-SUSPEND-LICENSE
      DESCRIPTION: Suspend an active license
    PROCESS: PROC-REVOKE-LICENSE
      DESCRIPTION: Revoke a license (permanent)
    PROCESS: PROC-INQUIRE-APPLICATION-STATUS
      DESCRIPTION: End-to-end status inquiry for an application
